	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Front end: APD Hamamatsu S12023-10 (Ø1.0 mm, 6 pF; fallback S12023-05, Ø0.5 mm, 2 pF): cathode ← APD_BIAS (100–220 V) through RC filter\\n(e.g. 10 kΩ + 10 nF, ≥250 V C0G, PROPOSED) and series current limit; anode → TIA_IN (same polarity as before). Optional alternate footprint: FDS010 TO-5\\n(bench fallback only; the APD path is the design). Keep HV 200 V creepage/keep-out from TIA_IN. → OPA857 TIA on 3V3 (5k/20k select, 20k linear range 60 µA\\nis the saturation bound; ambient is multiplied by M, optical bandpass filter mandatory) → matched 100 nF AC coupling with 10k returns → VCA821 VGA on ±3V7\\n(RF 402 Ω, RG 80 Ω starting values, VG control) → 10 nF / 10k level shift to VCM_DET → SDET. PROPOSED; OPA857 stability at 6 pF UNRESOLVED."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
